  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire &#x2013; Gender review and training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2020, Catalystas Consulting conducted a study on behalf of the Netherland embassy in Abidjan, C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, on the position of women in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire&apos;s entrepreneurship ecosystem.One of the conclusions of this study was that more can be done on gender sensitivity at the programme level (Orange Corners CDI and OCIF) and institutional level (local service provider of Orange Corners CDI).Therefore, this project aims to enhance and stimulate gender-sensitive approaches within the Orange Corners&apos; incubation programme and OCIF in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, through an analytical review and capacity-building programme for the service provider.Thereby, contributing to and strengthening the startup ecosystem in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire regarding women&apos;s economic empowerment and increasing female participation in Orange Corners.</narrative>
  </description>
